#: ../../../release/dev/FindOpenMP-clang-libomp.rst:2
msgid "FindOpenMP-clang-libomp"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release/dev/FindOpenMP-clang-libomp.rst:4
msgid ""
"The :module:`FindOpenMP` module, with Clang targeting the MSVC ABI, now "
"prefers the OpenMP runtime shipped with the compiler, e.g. ``libomp.dll``, "
"over the one shipped with MSVC.  Set ``OpenMP_libomp_LIBRARY`` to select a "
"different library."
msgstr ""
